      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The reported bug is due to this asset conflicting with VRChat's built-in avatar scaling system after attempts to further optimize VRChat constraints.\n\nWe're looking at restoring this use case for now in a way that does not require the workaround I suggested to another user on Discord, but please note that we can't guarantee this will remain possible forever.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
